replyContent:
Dear user, you can adjust the Hanafi Time by the following steps:
1-Log in to WeMuslim > Tap "Me";
2-Tap "Settings" > Tap "Prayer Time";
3-Turn off "Recommended Setting";
4-Tap "Juristic Method" > Select what you want;
You can switch to Hanafi Time after completing these steps. Have a nice day on WeMuslim!

Dear user, if you do not wish to receive messages from strangers, please follow these steps:
1- Open WeMuslim > Click "Me";
2- Click "Setting" > Select "Privacy";
3- Ensure "Receive Strangers' Messages" is turned off.
You will not be able to receive messages from strangers. Have a nice day at WeMuslim!

Dear user, you can turn off the notification function by following the steps below:
1. Go to the "Message/ME" page and select the settings function;
2. Scroll down to find the message notification section and click on the message notification you want to turn off.

Dear user, we are urgently repairing the network issue. Please wait patiently and try to solve it via the following methods:
1. Close the app and reopen it;
2. If it cannot be loaded, please wait patiently and try more times;
3. If it still cannot be loaded after the above steps, please connect to VPN and try again.
